WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:10.520
Welcome to Implementation Infrastructure. In this lesson, we explore this purpose: Make process use sustainable through resources, skills and oversight.

2
00:00:10.520 --> 00:00:20.600
Consider this scenario. A documented process is ignored across multiple teams. First understand the problem before producing documentation.

3
00:00:20.600 --> 00:00:30.220
Start with two steps: Resource the required work. Then Enable people to use processes. Each step should be explained and evidenced.

4
00:00:30.220 --> 00:00:39.600
Continue with Verify routine application. Then Improve adoption and reliability. Verify the results against the intended outcome.

5
00:00:39.600 --> 00:00:59.790
Stronger evidence looks like this: Stronger: contemporaneous role assignments, training evidence, compliance observations tied to real work. Weaker evidence would be: Weaker: equating published procedures with routine adoption; no trace of consistent use. Triangulate independent sources.

6
00:00:59.790 --> 00:01:14.040
Now your turn. Review four documents and two interviews, identify inconsistencies and complete the mastery challenge. This video is an independent teaching explanation, not official CMMI model wording.
